{"slug":"gangland-undercover-evenlm","title":"Gangland Undercover","titleEn":"Gangland Undercover","type":"series","year":2015,"rating":8,"duration":45,"description":"Gangland Undercover is a Canadian-American fact-based drama television series written and created by executive producer Stephen Kemp and co-writer Noel Baker. It was inspired by the story of Charles Falco a former ATF confidential informant (CI) who infiltrated an outlaw motorcycle club. The series is based on the memoir Vagos, Mongols, and Outlaws: My Infiltration of America's Deadliest Biker Gangs written by Charles Falco with Kerrie Droban. It premiered on Tuesday, February 24, 2015, on the History Channel at 10/9c. In Canada, Season 2 premiered on September 26, 2016. In the U.S., only the first episode of season 2 aired on December 8, 2016, on A&E. According to the trailer, \"the new season\" premiered on March 2, 2017. History US has cancelled Gangland Undercover just eight episodes into Season 2.","genres":["جنایی","درام"],"poster":"/covers/tt4341996/poster.jpg","backdrop":"/covers/tt4341996/backdrop.jpg","posterUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt4341996/img","backdropUrl":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt4341996/img","videoUrl":"","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=71SjMz_r33w","director":"","cast":["Damon Runyan","Ian Matthews","Ari Cohen"],"country":"کانادا، آمریکا","ageRating":"+13","quality":"HD","sources":[],"featured":false,"trendingScore":0,"views":0,"source":"f2m","addedAt":"2026-09-13T23:26:35.378Z","episodes":[{"season":1,"number":1,"name":"قسمت 1","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series/Gangland.Undercover/Gangland.Undercover.S01E01.1080p.WEB-DL.Farsi.Sub.Film2Media.mkv","sources":[],"thumbnail":"/api/cover/gangland-undercover-evenlm.svg"},{"season":1,"number":2,"name":"قسمت 2","synopsis":"","duration":45,"videoUrl":"https://bvxbbajdhgxd9g87jwb463wx.abrtech.top/yA3f/Series/Gangland.Unde